{
 "id": "qin-vo-full-01",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "words": true,
 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_A",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[quietly, nervous] 嘘，大家小声点。这走廊，怎么每条都长得一样啊。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly, surprised] 诶，在那儿。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[startled, shouting] 谁！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[straining, grunting] 嗯——！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[timid] 陛下，要、要不要帮您……",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sharp] 住口。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[panicked, fast] 陛下饶命！我们不是刺客！我们是来给您拍纪录的，记录陛下的一天！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 记录朕？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[eager, nervous] 是是是！让天下百姓都看看，陛下有多英明神武！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quieter, a little curious] 英明神武？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[shy, sincere] 千古一帝。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[clears throat, gruff, embarrassed] 咳。拍好看点。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[gruff, proud] 跟上。朕今天，带你见见世面。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[small happy laugh] 嘿嘿，遵命。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_B",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[amazed] 哇，好多竹简……陛下，这是在称重吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, not looking up] 今天的，还差三十斤。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[confused] 奏章……是论斤算的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "嗯。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smug] 你搬一捆试试。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[straining] 是。唔……好沉……",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[amused] 呵。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[softly, caring, a little out of breath] 陛下，您每天都这样吗？好辛苦啊。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[pauses, grudgingly pleased] 这句，留着。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_C",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious] 陛下平时，有什么喜欢做的事吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[low, secretive] 找神仙。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[surprised] 神仙？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[excited, oily] 陛下！仙药有消息了！只是……海里有条大鱼，挡着道。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "58791ad7bc6d818a68e8981ab4ccea600a45458a5e4c8c1d032528f2b8c3e6a1",
      "voice_id": "mZc8T5doZrU7OCI71i3M",
      "name": "HanBaba"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "鱼？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[hesitant] 好大一条。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "58791ad7bc6d818a68e8981ab4ccea600a45458a5e4c8c1d032528f2b8c3e6a1",
      "voice_id": "mZc8T5doZrU7OCI71i3M",
      "name": "HanBaba"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[commanding] 拿弩来。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly, to the audience] 偷偷告诉大家，这个徐福，后来再也没回来。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 你在说什么？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flustered, too cheerful] 没、没什么！祝徐先生一路顺风！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_D",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[displeased, low] 丞相出个门，带这么多车？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "哼。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly] 诶……车少了好多。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[slow, cold] 昨天朕那句话，是谁传出去的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[very quiet, menacing] 你。昨天，在不在？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[terrified, small voice] 不、不在。我什么都没拍到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_E",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[pleased, showing off] 来，给你看样东西。上回出巡。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[grand] 这棵树，挡雨有功。封它，五大夫。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 树……也能封官吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact] 朕说能，就能。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[annoyed] 这山上供的，是什么神？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[slow, solemn] 回陛下，是尧的女儿，舜的妃子。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "MartinLi"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[furious, shouting] 砍！全给朕砍了！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly, to the audience] 以后，千万别惹陛下。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_F",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[low] 今晚，出去走走。不许声张。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly] 陛下，只带四个人吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "够了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[holding back a laugh] 陛下，您的珠子……露出来了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[hissing] 嘘！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[scared, shouting] 啊！有人！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[composing himself, gruff] 刚才，朕没有吓到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "是，陛下没有吓到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "那段，删了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_G",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[softly, hopeful] 陛下？今天……还拍吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[thin, flat] 准。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "5c5962287b218047405eda9089bab96b2b24534c3e0fe1be105b6168cf79c324",
      "voice_id": "AAYMKjNBrET5q9uPiIQS",
      "name": "ZeyuLiu"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[thin, flat] 准。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "5c5962287b218047405eda9089bab96b2b24534c3e0fe1be105b6168cf79c324",
