    {
     "text": "[quiet, sad] 那年夏天，陛下死在了出巡的路上。大臣们不敢说，每天照样往车里递奏章。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quiet] 天太热，车里有了味道。他们就拉了一车咸鱼，跟在后面。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quiet, wistful] 陛下一直，想长生不老。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[gentle] 他没活过五十岁。可他的兵马俑，站了两千多年。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[off-screen, weak, gentle] 这段，也删了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
